WEBVTT

01:36.580 --> 01:40.940
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.370 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 1]

01:46.039 --> 01:47.500
In the early years of Daxi,

01:47.680 --> 01:49.880
chaos spread across the martial world.

01:49.950 --> 01:51.680
The righteous sects declined,

01:51.710 --> 01:53.280
while the Power Gang,
the biggest sect in the martial world,

01:53.280 --> 01:55.590
dominated the scene.

01:56.870 --> 01:58.710
And Zhu the Great King of the Water Sect

01:58.710 --> 02:00.710
held unchallenged control
over the waterways.

02:00.710 --> 02:03.240
The two sects
were locked in fierce conflict.

02:05.320 --> 02:07.150
The Beihuang Army was wreaking havoc.

02:07.150 --> 02:08.840
The shadow of the southern migration
still lingers.

02:08.840 --> 02:11.240
The emperor was forced
to flee the capital.

02:12.080 --> 02:14.360
[Jinzhong]

02:12.310 --> 02:13.240
Meanwhile,

02:13.400 --> 02:14.800
the Hero Command Token, long lost

02:14.800 --> 02:17.190
to the martial world, resurfaced.

02:18.310 --> 02:19.590
It was said to contain
the ultimate treasure

02:19.590 --> 02:20.870
in the martial world.

02:21.150 --> 02:23.000
And it was in the hands
of the mother of Wu Jie,

02:23.000 --> 02:25.030
the famous general of Daxi.

02:25.470 --> 02:27.960
Martial artists everywhere
heard the news and sprang into action.

02:27.960 --> 02:29.400
They set up ambushes along the way,

02:29.400 --> 02:31.120
chasing Old Madam Wu
all the way to Jinzhong,

02:31.120 --> 02:33.400
cornering her with no way out.

02:39.310 --> 02:40.360
At this critical moment,

02:40.360 --> 02:42.630
a young hero appeared.

02:42.730 --> 02:44.520
He saved Old Madam Wu from the Water King

02:44.520 --> 02:45.560
of the Power Gang.

02:46.150 --> 02:48.560
He's Xiao Qiushui, Third Young Master

02:48.800 --> 02:49.750
of Huanhua Sect.

02:50.590 --> 02:52.750
Huanhua Sword Technique,
renowned for its agility,

02:52.750 --> 02:56.000
had been mastered
by Xiao Qiushui to perfection.

02:56.360 --> 02:57.630
With his immense internal energy

02:57.630 --> 02:59.360
and unmatched flying skill,

02:59.800 --> 03:01.870
his sword strikes were swift like meteors

03:01.870 --> 03:03.270
and powerful as thunder.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.560
Wielding Changge Sword,

03:04.560 --> 03:05.710
he singlehandedly defeated

03:05.710 --> 03:07.520
the forces of the Power Gang.

03:07.520 --> 03:10.590
That battle made him a legend.

03:23.310 --> 03:24.310
I am Xiao Qiushui.

03:24.590 --> 03:25.990
Greetings, Old Madam Wu.

03:27.640 --> 03:28.200
Goog boy!

03:29.329 --> 03:32.180
[Xiao Qiushui, Huanhua Sectt]

03:42.079 --> 03:42.680
Mingming.

03:43.960 --> 03:45.079
Get up quickly.

03:45.680 --> 03:46.680
How's "The Marvelous Heroes of Shenzhou"

03:46.680 --> 03:48.540
you adapted with the Magic Codex?

03:49.030 --> 03:51.240
I got you into a closed beta

03:51.520 --> 03:53.240
to fulfill your martial arts fantasy.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.120
With this Magic Codex,

03:54.120 --> 03:56.280
you just need to set up
the key story points

03:56.280 --> 03:57.560
and character profiles,

03:57.560 --> 03:58.800
and the AI in its system

03:58.800 --> 04:00.120
will finish

04:00.120 --> 04:01.150
the story for you.

04:06.430 --> 04:09.620
Welcome to the
Magic Codex Interactive Writing System.

04:12.960 --> 04:14.560
Since we're adapting the setting,

04:14.560 --> 04:16.160
the enhancements aren't enough.

04:16.160 --> 04:18.750
The male lead has to be a top-tier master
from the very start.

04:18.750 --> 04:19.600
His lightness skill,

04:19.600 --> 04:20.600
internal energy,

04:20.600 --> 04:22.600
and sword skill must all be the best.

04:27.390 --> 04:29.000
He should not only be graceful
and handsome,

04:29.000 --> 04:30.720
but also possess extraordinary talent,

04:30.720 --> 04:33.980
making him a once-in-a-generation
martial arts prodigy.

04:34.159 --> 04:35.020
By the age of 12,

04:35.120 --> 04:38.040
he had already mastered the Xiao family's
Huanhua Sword Technique.

04:38.040 --> 04:40.630
At 18,
he was personally taught by Crazy Yan,

04:40.830 --> 04:42.920
who implanted
the Boiling Blood Cocoon in him—

04:42.920 --> 04:44.159
which could unleash 600 years of power

04:44.159 --> 04:45.600
at a critical moment.

05:22.680 --> 05:23.800
At 20,

05:24.120 --> 05:26.600
he accidentally discovered
the world's greatest martial arts manual,

05:26.600 --> 05:27.800
the Voidheart Codex,

05:28.360 --> 05:31.020
and mastered
an unparalleled sword technique.

05:56.070 --> 05:57.530
He defeated the Power Gang

05:57.730 --> 05:58.990
and Zhu the Great King,

05:59.040 --> 06:00.080
and at just 20 years old,
became the leader

06:00.080 --> 06:01.630
of the Martial Arts Alliance Leader,

06:01.630 --> 06:03.430
leading his sworn brothers

06:03.430 --> 06:05.920
and fellow martial artists
to march south and fight against

06:05.920 --> 06:06.980
the Beihuang Army.

06:07.480 --> 06:10.000
General Wu, moved by his righteousness,

06:10.510 --> 06:12.910
presented him with the Hero Command Token.

06:13.080 --> 06:17.160
From then on,
Xiao Qiushui ruled the martial world.

06:25.360 --> 06:27.020
May you rule the martial world

06:27.190 --> 06:28.770
for thousands of years!

06:29.070 --> 06:30.730
May you rule the martial world

06:30.830 --> 06:32.630
for thousands of years!

06:33.190 --> 06:35.050
Standing at the pinnacle of life,

06:35.560 --> 06:38.220
Xiao Qiushui felt great
being the protagonist.

06:39.430 --> 06:41.430
He turned around, looking at the world,

06:41.430 --> 06:42.830
and said six words—

06:43.430 --> 06:43.960
No, wait—

06:44.560 --> 06:45.960
it should be eight words:

06:47.720 --> 06:49.250
I'm invincible in Shenzhou

06:50.270 --> 06:51.330
yet lonely as snow.

06:52.310 --> 06:53.510
User Xiao Mingming,

06:53.720 --> 06:55.600
thank you for using the Magic Codex System

06:55.600 --> 06:58.000
to adapt the novel
"the Marvelous Heroes of Shenzhou."

06:58.000 --> 07:01.120
Would you like to integrate this project
into the system?

07:01.120 --> 07:04.180
[This Magic Codex
that Li Cai gave me is pretty useful.]

07:04.750 --> 07:05.680
Not bad, not bad.

07:13.000 --> 07:13.870
System bug.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.480
System bug.

07:18.510 --> 07:20.830
Warning, the character's setting
is out of character.

07:20.830 --> 07:22.720
Warning, the character's setting
is out of character.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.050
Are you messing with me?

07:52.420 --> 07:53.370
Bravo!

07:53.780 --> 07:54.370
Bravo!

07:54.430 --> 07:54.920
Bravo!

07:55.800 --> 07:56.800
This way, please.

08:00.480 --> 08:00.950
Bravo!

08:01.600 --> 08:02.730
Please go upstairs.

08:04.870 --> 08:06.600
-Bravo!
-Come on. Cheers.

08:10.240 --> 08:11.040
This way, sir.

08:11.870 --> 08:13.270
A table upstairs for one!

08:13.870 --> 08:15.830
Yes, so beautiful.

08:16.600 --> 08:19.950
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

08:20.270 --> 08:21.190
Please wait a moment.

08:21.190 --> 08:22.250
I'll be right here.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.270
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

08:28.800 --> 08:29.750
Come on, sir, this way.

08:29.750 --> 08:30.240
Bravo!

08:30.870 --> 08:32.510
-Thank you.
-That was excellent dancing.

08:32.510 --> 08:33.909
You have good taste, sir.

08:39.000 --> 08:39.789
Bravo!

08:41.000 --> 08:42.120
Third Young Master.

08:42.120 --> 08:44.000
-Third Young Master.
-Third Young Master.

08:44.000 --> 08:45.600
Third Young Master, wake up.

08:45.960 --> 08:47.220
Why isn't he waking up?

08:47.960 --> 08:49.390
Why has he slept so long today?

08:49.390 --> 08:49.910
Yes.

08:49.910 --> 08:52.200
It's been so long,
and he's still not awake.

08:52.200 --> 08:53.390
-Third Young Master.
-Third Young Master.

08:53.390 --> 08:54.030
Third Young Master.

08:54.030 --> 08:55.030
Third Young Master, wake up.

08:55.030 --> 08:56.200
Third Young Master, wake up.

08:56.200 --> 08:57.330
Third Young Master.

08:57.360 --> 08:58.960
Third Young Master, wake up.

08:59.870 --> 09:01.200
Third Young Master is awake!

09:01.200 --> 09:02.630
Third Young Master is awake!

09:02.630 --> 09:03.440
Third Young Master is awake!

09:03.440 --> 09:05.500
Third Young Master, are you alright?

09:05.630 --> 09:06.760
Third Young Master.

09:07.270 --> 09:08.670
[I feel so dizzy.]

09:09.390 --> 09:10.240
Third Young Master.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.080
Thank goodness.

09:11.080 --> 09:12.270
He's finally awakened.

09:12.270 --> 09:13.510
Yes, finally.

09:14.030 --> 09:14.790
Third Young Master,

09:14.790 --> 09:15.920
does your head hurt?

09:15.960 --> 09:16.820
How do you feel?

09:20.320 --> 09:21.450
Third Young Master,

09:21.790 --> 09:22.720
are you alright?

09:29.840 --> 09:31.390
[What's going on here?]

09:32.270 --> 09:33.480
[Where am I?]

09:33.960 --> 09:35.620
Please have some water first.

09:37.360 --> 09:39.200
Who are you guys? Where's Li Cai?

09:41.750 --> 09:42.510
I got it.

09:43.240 --> 09:45.370
You're the actresses he hired, right?

09:47.120 --> 09:49.320
"Actress?" What are "actress?"

09:50.350 --> 09:50.960
Yesterday,

09:50.960 --> 09:51.790
you and your friends

09:51.790 --> 09:53.450
picked this illegal gambling den

09:53.450 --> 09:54.510
on this street to celebrate,

09:54.510 --> 09:55.390
got drunk,

09:55.840 --> 09:57.960
and you ended up resting here.

09:59.270 --> 10:00.530
[Third Young Master?]

10:01.840 --> 10:02.750
Could it be…

10:02.960 --> 10:03.840
that because I watched
The Sword of the Third Young Master

10:03.840 --> 10:05.300
the day before yesterday,

10:05.670 --> 10:07.800
I'm having a dream about Xie Xiaofeng?

10:08.870 --> 10:10.390
Why is this dream so weird?

10:11.840 --> 10:13.870
Third Young Master, what's wrong?

10:19.600 --> 10:21.130
Even the props look so real.

10:22.870 --> 10:24.080
Is there a problem?

10:28.390 --> 10:30.000
Oh my... It's so weird.

10:30.510 --> 10:32.710
Third Young Master, what's the matter?

10:35.390 --> 10:37.600
This isn't right. Something's off.

10:48.300 --> 10:51.070
[Xiao Qiushui]

10:59.960 --> 11:00.840
Young Master Xiao...

11:00.840 --> 11:01.670
Be careful.

11:10.600 --> 11:11.800
What did you just say?

11:12.670 --> 11:13.730
Young Master Xiao?

11:14.750 --> 11:16.120
Stop teasing me.

11:16.360 --> 11:18.510
Aren't you Xiao Qiushui,
the Third Young Master

11:18.510 --> 11:19.440
of Huanhua Sect?

11:32.230 --> 11:33.890
Xiao Qiushui of Huanhua Sect?

11:37.240 --> 11:38.900
Xiao Qiushui of Huanhua Sect?

11:38.910 --> 11:39.440
Yeas.

11:40.360 --> 11:41.690
Wait, am I not dreaming?

11:42.750 --> 11:45.750
I've... I've...
transmigrated into a novel?

11:47.910 --> 11:48.370
Wait...

11:48.840 --> 11:51.910
Is this the Daxi era now?

11:51.910 --> 11:52.690
Yes, it is.

12:02.550 --> 12:05.440
Upstream along the Huanhua Creek
in the western suburbs of Jindu,

12:05.440 --> 12:07.240
there is a Huanhua Sect.

12:08.080 --> 12:11.750
The patriarch of the family, Xiao Xilou,
is highly respected in Jinzhong.

12:11.750 --> 12:13.920
The Xiao family is prestigious locally.

12:13.920 --> 12:15.920
Xiao Xilou has 3 sons and a daughter.

12:16.030 --> 12:18.080
The youngest son is

12:18.080 --> 12:21.390
the recently famous Xiao Qiushui
in the martial world.

12:21.960 --> 12:24.600
[Could it be that I've ended up inside]

12:24.600 --> 12:25.430
[the martial arts novel]

12:25.430 --> 12:26.840
[Marvelous Heroes of Shenzhou that I rewrote?]

12:26.840 --> 12:28.550
Now I've become Xiao Qiushui,

12:29.320 --> 12:30.850
not Xiao Mingming anymore?

12:34.320 --> 12:34.910
Let's go over there and take a look.

12:34.910 --> 12:36.370
It's really lively today.

12:36.390 --> 12:38.790
The private room
has been prepared for you.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.750
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

12:43.630 --> 12:45.090
In my version of the story,

12:45.510 --> 12:46.840
the 20-year-old Xiao Qiushui

12:46.840 --> 12:48.870
has already mastered
unparalleled martial arts skills

12:48.870 --> 12:51.440
and has the Boiling Blood Cocoon
that can enhance his power at any time.

12:51.440 --> 12:53.510
He is a top expert in the martial world,

12:53.510 --> 12:56.150
the best in lightness skills,
internal energy, and sword skill.

12:56.150 --> 12:58.030
[Looks like my luck]

12:58.030 --> 12:59.360
[is not that bad at all.]

12:59.670 --> 13:01.600
Not only did I transmigrate into
the main character,

13:01.600 --> 13:04.800
but I also arrived at
the most glorious moment of his life.

13:07.630 --> 13:08.830
Even if it's not real,

13:09.480 --> 13:11.360
it's nice to dream in this novel.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.120
Get out of the way!

13:13.910 --> 13:14.570
Move aside!

13:16.550 --> 13:17.240
Stop looking!

13:17.240 --> 13:18.440
The thugs from the illegal gambling den
are here to kill you!

13:18.440 --> 13:19.440
What should we do?

13:19.510 --> 13:20.200
Get out of the way!

13:20.200 --> 13:21.260
Hurry! Move aside!

13:22.960 --> 13:23.890
No need to panic.

13:26.080 --> 13:27.200
I have a plan.

13:30.120 --> 13:30.720
Excuse me.

13:34.270 --> 13:35.720
Let me show you

13:36.120 --> 13:38.320
the supreme lightness skill I created.

13:38.510 --> 13:39.710
Swift as a flying bird

13:40.600 --> 13:42.400
and moving like a gentle breeze!

13:46.440 --> 13:48.170
Something doesn't feel right.

13:53.200 --> 13:55.260
Where's my supreme lightness skill?

13:55.750 --> 13:57.550
Xiao Qiushui, stop right there!

14:08.110 --> 14:08.770
Be careful!

14:10.120 --> 14:11.180
Young Master Xiao?

14:11.200 --> 14:12.460
His sister is here too?

14:13.360 --> 14:13.960
My sister?

14:28.350 --> 14:30.880
[Xiao Xueyu, Huanhua Sect]

14:34.080 --> 14:36.600
Qiushui, you got into trouble again, huh?

14:39.840 --> 14:40.840
Come home with me.

14:40.870 --> 14:42.200
Let's see how Father punishes you
this time.

14:42.200 --> 14:42.730
Let's go.

14:47.230 --> 14:49.590
[Huanhua Sect]

14:59.810 --> 15:01.880
[Xiao Xilou, Leader of Huanhua Sect]

15:09.350 --> 15:11.080
[Xiao Kaiyan, Huanhua Sect]
[Xiao Xing, Huanhua Sect]

15:14.240 --> 15:15.840
So you've finally come back.

15:27.550 --> 15:29.150
How many times has this been?

15:33.790 --> 15:34.720
Raise your head!

15:35.510 --> 15:36.240
Look at me!

15:39.030 --> 15:40.030
Tell me honestly,

15:40.230 --> 15:42.230
and you might avoid a beating today.

15:49.960 --> 15:52.560
So you've learned
to hang around brothels now?

15:54.360 --> 15:56.550
Do you even remember who you are?

15:58.960 --> 15:59.960
Still drunk, huh?

16:00.550 --> 16:01.550
Chasing courtesans

16:01.550 --> 16:02.790
and staying out all night.

16:02.790 --> 16:04.200
This time, Father is going to punish you,

16:04.200 --> 16:06.460
and don't expect anyone to plead for you.

16:10.000 --> 16:10.600
Father?

16:11.790 --> 16:12.670
This is...

16:13.510 --> 16:14.320
my father?

16:24.840 --> 16:26.440
[In the original story,
Xiao Xilou seemed to]

16:26.440 --> 16:27.960
[dislike Xiao Qiushui the most.]

16:27.960 --> 16:29.560
[He thinks he's too unruly.]

16:31.600 --> 16:33.600
[A wise man knows when to back down.]

16:33.720 --> 16:34.650
Kneel properly!

16:38.270 --> 16:39.240
Unfilial son.

16:41.200 --> 16:42.240
Unfilial son.

16:49.360 --> 16:49.910
Qiushui.

16:50.750 --> 16:51.390
Qiushui.

16:52.520 --> 16:53.450
Father, Father.

16:53.790 --> 16:54.450
I was wrong.

17:01.600 --> 17:02.480
It's weird.

17:03.150 --> 17:05.000
You're usually so stubborn.

17:06.060 --> 17:08.790
Why did you admit
you were wrong so quickly today?

17:09.550 --> 17:12.069
Father, Qiushui is just young and playful.

17:12.550 --> 17:13.680
But he's been investigating

17:13.680 --> 17:15.960
the Beihuang Army spies in Jinzhong,

17:16.310 --> 17:17.640
just as you instructed.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.200
I see.

17:28.030 --> 17:29.090
If that's the case,

17:29.270 --> 17:29.880
then…

17:29.880 --> 17:32.240
Father, we should ask Qiushui

17:33.000 --> 17:34.200
what he has found out.

17:42.920 --> 17:43.980
Well then, tell us.

17:45.480 --> 17:46.010
Qiushui,

17:46.790 --> 17:48.420
these past few days, Kaiyan and I

17:48.420 --> 17:49.880
have been running around.

17:49.920 --> 17:50.980
I didn't expect you

17:51.350 --> 17:53.010
to be so lazy and unmotivated.

17:54.110 --> 17:56.570
[You're the only one
with a mouth here, huh?]

17:59.440 --> 18:00.900
Let's think this through.

18:00.960 --> 18:01.430
Father,

18:01.960 --> 18:04.110
Qiushui's mistake
is quite serious this time.

18:04.110 --> 18:05.680
He should be punished properly.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.340
[You're twisting the knife?]

18:07.550 --> 18:10.110
[My second brother
is actually making it worse?]

18:10.110 --> 18:11.370
This is backstabbing.

18:12.590 --> 18:14.390
Aren't you two my real brothers?

18:15.110 --> 18:17.310
Is it necessary to pour fuel on the fire?

18:17.660 --> 18:19.550
Since Father asked me to teach you
martial arts on his behalf,

18:19.550 --> 18:21.270
I have the right to discipline you.

18:21.270 --> 18:23.680
Father, a tree won't grow straight
without pruning,

18:23.680 --> 18:25.240
and a person won't succeed
without teaching.

18:25.240 --> 18:25.640
Right.

18:30.920 --> 18:33.880
Alright.
Let's resort to the punishing rod.

18:34.220 --> 18:34.980
Xilou.

18:39.720 --> 18:42.330
A child's misbehavior
is also the mother's fault.

18:42.330 --> 18:43.970
Why don't you let me, his mother,

18:42.590 --> 18:44.670
[Sun Huishan, Huanhua Sect]

18:44.440 --> 18:46.500
give this mischievous brat a lesson?

18:46.590 --> 18:50.070
Mingming, here, the noodles are ready.

18:52.110 --> 18:52.790
Mom?

18:54.550 --> 18:55.200
Yiren!

18:57.320 --> 18:58.250
Bring the cane.

18:58.270 --> 18:59.640
Mother, maybe we should let Yiren...

18:59.640 --> 19:00.110
Yes.

19:01.750 --> 19:02.410
Step aside!

19:07.880 --> 19:08.480
[Mom,]

19:08.640 --> 19:10.350
[how did you come back to life here too?]

19:10.350 --> 19:12.550
But why isn't my dad my real dad anymore?

19:13.110 --> 19:14.310
Why are you laughing?

19:16.030 --> 19:17.550
You little brat.

19:18.830 --> 19:20.560
You cause trouble everywhere.

19:20.590 --> 19:22.750
I'm going to teach you a lesson today!

19:23.440 --> 19:25.700
Let's see if you dare make trouble again.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.510
[Mom, you're really hitting me?]

19:29.510 --> 19:31.510
You're not wearing that underwear?

19:36.480 --> 19:37.680
One whip, and you run.

19:40.000 --> 19:41.000
Stop right there!

19:41.200 --> 19:41.550
Mom!

19:41.550 --> 19:43.270
-Where are you going, you brat?
-Be gentle.

19:43.270 --> 19:44.640
-Stop right there!
-Don't hit me for real!

19:44.640 --> 19:45.720
Let's see where you can run to!

19:45.720 --> 19:46.350
Stop!

19:46.480 --> 19:47.480
-Stop!
-It hurts!

19:47.680 --> 19:48.680
I'll beat you to death today!

19:48.680 --> 19:50.140
She's really hitting him?

20:04.720 --> 20:05.650
Have a cup of tea.

20:07.510 --> 20:12.110
Mother, so this is what you meant?

20:12.750 --> 20:13.680
Of course.

20:14.360 --> 20:16.280
You always your father angry.

20:16.310 --> 20:18.440
I especially made
these leather shorts for you.

20:18.440 --> 20:20.100
This isn't ordinary leather.

20:20.240 --> 20:21.870
It's from a Diamond Python.

20:22.000 --> 20:24.000
Normal swords can't even pierce it.

20:26.350 --> 20:27.030
Mother.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.060
I thought...

20:31.480 --> 20:33.070
I would never see you again.

20:34.270 --> 20:35.760
You silly child.

20:36.210 --> 20:38.870
What are you doing?
Are you cursing your mother?

20:40.840 --> 20:43.730
Mother, it's so good to see you.

20:45.880 --> 20:47.940
You actually have tears in your eyes.

20:53.030 --> 20:55.920
Mom, where does

20:57.270 --> 20:59.000
my martial skill stand now?

21:01.340 --> 21:02.070
What?

21:06.680 --> 21:08.400
I mean level.

21:09.110 --> 21:12.110
Isn't there always some ranking
in the martial world?

21:13.070 --> 21:14.930
I know I'm definitely not first,

21:15.110 --> 21:17.790
but I should
at least be on the list, right?

21:30.070 --> 21:31.400
Are you running a fever?

21:32.030 --> 21:32.430
No.

21:33.590 --> 21:35.320
Your rank in the martial world?

21:35.960 --> 21:36.820
Let me tell you—

21:37.240 --> 21:38.570
here in this household,

21:38.770 --> 21:39.720
you're ranked fifth.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.290
Your father, your mother,

21:41.440 --> 21:42.480
your big brother, your second brother,

21:42.480 --> 21:43.280
and then you.

21:47.720 --> 21:49.080
But I...

21:49.080 --> 21:51.640
aren't I supposed to have
extraordinary talent

21:51.640 --> 21:53.070
and remarkable potential?

21:53.070 --> 21:55.310
Yes, you do have good fundamentals.

21:55.650 --> 21:58.200
But you were such a wild child
while growing up.

21:58.200 --> 22:00.130
Your father and I didn't force you.

22:00.590 --> 22:02.000
You didn't properly practice
the Xiao's Sword Technique

22:02.000 --> 22:04.600
and created
your own Qiushui Sword Technique.

22:06.680 --> 22:09.880
You didn't lose a fight with someone

22:09.880 --> 22:10.940
this time, did you?

22:11.720 --> 22:12.160
No.

22:17.160 --> 22:19.240
Mom, how's my lightness skill?

22:20.070 --> 22:21.920
It's always been your weak spot.

22:22.000 --> 22:22.920
What about my internal energy?

22:22.920 --> 22:24.150
It's average.

22:27.270 --> 22:29.790
Why are you being so weird?

22:29.790 --> 22:30.590
Did you lose your memory?

22:30.590 --> 22:32.990
Why are you asking
so many questions today?

22:35.270 --> 22:37.310
This isn't quite what I imagined.

22:38.070 --> 22:41.200
Mother, how big is the gap between me
and that Li Chenzhou

22:41.200 --> 22:42.330
from the Power Gang?

22:50.720 --> 22:54.110
Qiushui, you can joke about other things,

22:54.750 --> 22:55.810
but on this matter,

22:56.110 --> 22:58.370
you must remember what your father said:

22:58.480 --> 23:00.810
never provoke anyone from the Power Gang.

23:02.550 --> 23:05.000
The Power Gang rules the martial world

23:05.000 --> 23:06.000
and kills as will.

23:06.110 --> 23:07.920
Countless heroes

23:07.920 --> 23:09.960
have mysteriously died under their blades.

23:09.960 --> 23:11.920
Every one
of the 19 Demons of Heaven and Earth

23:11.920 --> 23:12.920
is a top-tier master

23:12.920 --> 23:15.000
in the martial world.

23:15.480 --> 23:17.940
And their chief you mentioned,
Li Chenzhou,

23:17.960 --> 23:19.790
is even more unfathomable.

23:24.070 --> 23:27.160
Stop spending every day
dreaming unrealistic dreams

23:27.440 --> 23:29.170
of becoming famous overnight.

23:31.480 --> 23:33.080
Without martial arts skill,

23:33.750 --> 23:35.750
how dare I challenge the Power Gang?

23:37.640 --> 23:38.970
Wait, that Crazy Yan...

23:40.200 --> 23:40.830
Didn't Crazy Yan

23:40.830 --> 23:42.510
unblock my Ren and Du meridians?

23:42.510 --> 23:44.300
When Crazy Yan disappeared,

23:44.320 --> 23:45.830
you were just a little kid.

23:46.400 --> 23:49.330
And he hasn't shown up
in the martial world for years.

23:50.070 --> 23:51.480
If he really shows up,

23:51.750 --> 23:54.790
there'd probably be blood and chaos
all over again.

24:00.620 --> 24:01.550
Mom, let me do it.

24:03.240 --> 24:05.310
Mom, do we have

24:06.270 --> 24:08.530
any super powerful martial arts manual?

24:08.680 --> 24:09.790
You know, the kind that

24:09.790 --> 24:11.160
can make you improve rapidly
once you practice it.

24:11.160 --> 24:13.680
Don't you dare say that
in front of your father.

24:13.680 --> 24:15.510
You haven't even mastered
Huanhua Sword Technique yet,

24:15.510 --> 24:17.640
and you're already thinking about
learning other skills.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.170
Alright.

24:18.580 --> 24:20.550
Mom, let me ask you one last question.

24:20.550 --> 24:22.960
Why do you have so many questions today?
Mother, one last question.

24:22.960 --> 24:25.240
Is Xueyu really my sister?

24:26.410 --> 24:28.720
Xueyu is our Xiao family's
adopted daughter.

24:28.720 --> 24:30.270
She's had a tough life.

24:30.590 --> 24:33.590
You should take good care of your sister,
understand?

24:35.310 --> 24:35.900
Okay.

24:36.270 --> 24:38.070
Now stop overthinking.

24:38.960 --> 24:40.560
I'm going to see your father.

24:40.640 --> 24:41.240
Remember,

24:41.320 --> 24:42.970
don't make him angry, okay?

24:43.030 --> 24:43.830
Alright, Mom.

24:45.310 --> 24:46.170
Eat the orange.

24:46.310 --> 24:46.680
Okay.

24:57.160 --> 25:00.110
Xiao Qiushui's character setting
is from the original novel,

25:00.110 --> 25:02.770
but somehow the changes I made to Xueyu
got kept.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.440
Could this be…

25:04.590 --> 25:07.650
interactive storytelling
powered by the Magic Codex?

25:08.110 --> 25:10.000
Maybe if I raise my combat level,

25:10.310 --> 25:12.110
I'll return to the story I wrote.

25:13.240 --> 25:13.890
Whatever.

25:14.240 --> 25:15.900
Let me gather some gear first.

25:20.800 --> 25:23.340
[Xiao's Sword Tomb]

25:31.680 --> 25:32.680
So many swords.

25:36.590 --> 25:38.160
I read it in a hurry back then.

25:38.160 --> 25:39.720
I only skimmed the novel.

25:40.400 --> 25:42.000
I barely remember anything.

25:42.480 --> 25:43.750
But I do remember

25:43.750 --> 25:45.610
the protagonist's golden cheat.

25:46.030 --> 25:47.960
I remember
the legendary martial arts manual,

25:47.960 --> 25:50.000
The Voidheart Codex,

25:50.510 --> 25:52.510
was hidden right here
in the Xiao's Sword Tomb.

25:52.510 --> 25:54.370
I'd better look for it carefully.

25:55.270 --> 25:56.400
But where is it?

26:14.510 --> 26:16.110
I can't see it. I can't see it.

27:04.640 --> 27:07.040
Such an extraordinary martial arts manual

27:07.270 --> 27:09.600
must be hidden in a very mysterious place.

27:39.480 --> 27:41.440
In lots of martial arts novels,

27:43.030 --> 27:44.640
top-tier manuals

27:44.640 --> 27:46.770
are hidden in stone coffins like this.

27:49.270 --> 27:49.930
Never mind.

27:52.440 --> 27:53.750
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

28:24.310 --> 28:25.770
Why are there only swords?

28:27.400 --> 28:28.530
No Voidheart Codex?

28:31.960 --> 28:35.200
Welcome to the
Magic Codex Interactive Writing System.

28:37.080 --> 28:38.120
Hello, User.

28:38.750 --> 28:40.480
You deviated
from the original character settings

28:40.480 --> 28:42.590
while using the Magic Codex.

28:43.000 --> 28:46.240
Please restart
The New Marvelous Heroes of Shenzhou.

28:48.420 --> 28:50.020
You're the Magic Codex, huh?

28:50.070 --> 28:51.400
Come on, show yourself.

28:51.750 --> 28:53.210
Stop being so mysterious.

28:54.590 --> 28:55.110
Fine.

28:56.440 --> 28:57.300
How about this?

28:57.550 --> 28:58.880
Let's talk about it.

28:59.100 --> 29:00.460
Let me ask you something.

29:00.460 --> 29:02.660
Why can't I take some creative liberty?

29:02.680 --> 29:04.270
The Marvelous Heroes of Shenzhou

29:04.270 --> 29:06.400
is a classic 1980s martial arts novel.

29:06.830 --> 29:08.920
It's not like the overpowered
wish-fulfillment stories

29:08.920 --> 29:10.110
popular these days.

29:10.850 --> 29:12.680
It follows
the traditional martial arts novel setting

29:12.680 --> 29:14.390
where the male protagonist starts
as an ordinary person,

29:14.390 --> 29:15.590
needing to endure hardship

29:15.590 --> 29:16.510
and train his body and mind

29:16.510 --> 29:19.370
before ultimately becoming
a martial arts master.

29:19.880 --> 29:22.550
The Magic Codex
will preserve the essence of the original

29:22.550 --> 29:25.880
and make reasonable adaptations
based on this foundation.

29:25.960 --> 29:27.480
To hell with your adaptations.

29:27.480 --> 29:29.720
Classic martial arts novels
also need a fresh take.

29:29.720 --> 29:31.830
What fun is a story if the protagonist
doesn't have any golden cheats?

29:31.830 --> 29:32.790
Besides,

29:33.440 --> 29:36.400
real life is frustrating enough.

29:36.750 --> 29:38.950
Do I really have to suffer in a novel too?

29:41.000 --> 29:42.130
Cat got your tongue?

29:42.200 --> 29:43.550
I'm asking you a question.

29:43.550 --> 29:44.830
Not going to answer, huh?

29:44.830 --> 29:46.310
Fine. I'm out.

29:46.750 --> 29:47.680
I'm going back to work.

29:47.680 --> 29:51.790
You can't leave. You can't quit

29:52.110 --> 29:54.110
until the main mission is complete.

29:56.750 --> 29:58.550
Playing this trick with me, huh?

29:59.310 --> 30:01.830
Start your story
with Xiao Qiushui going to Zihui

30:01.830 --> 30:04.550
and end it with him becoming

30:05.200 --> 30:07.130
the Martial Arts Alliance Leader.

30:10.070 --> 30:10.510
Wait.

30:12.440 --> 30:13.840
Let me ask you something.

30:14.000 --> 30:15.260
In this chaotic world,

30:15.750 --> 30:17.000
there's the Power Gang,

30:17.000 --> 30:18.090
Zhu the Great King,

30:18.240 --> 30:19.640
and the Northern Wastelander.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.440
If you don't let me have a golden cheat,

30:21.440 --> 30:23.550
how could I survive until next year's
Martial Arts Tournament?

30:23.550 --> 30:24.610
Are you kidding me?

30:24.870 --> 30:27.350
If you can become the sect leader
of Huanhua Sect,

30:27.350 --> 30:30.000
you'll enter your own plot outline,

30:30.030 --> 30:32.740
and the Magic Codex
won't interfere with your creation.

30:32.740 --> 30:33.890
Before that,

30:33.920 --> 30:36.650
pay attention
to the following creative taboos:

30:36.680 --> 30:39.410
You are forbidden
from spoiling key plot points.

30:41.740 --> 30:44.800
The pouch will constantly
remind you of your progress.

30:48.830 --> 30:50.030
What if I just refuse?

30:51.350 --> 30:53.240
Remember the buff you gave yourself,

30:53.240 --> 30:54.700
the Boiling Blood Cocoon?

30:54.980 --> 30:56.310
It's been changed into

30:56.330 --> 30:58.650
a gu poison lying dormant in your hand.

30:59.400 --> 31:00.960
If you break a taboo,

31:01.310 --> 31:03.510
the Boiling Blood Cocoon will activate.

31:03.510 --> 31:05.310
The first time will be a warning,

31:05.350 --> 31:07.480
and the second time will kill you.

31:08.480 --> 31:09.790
How nasty.

31:10.550 --> 31:11.480
Remember,

31:11.480 --> 31:12.550
this is

31:12.570 --> 31:15.350
a simple growth-oriented story
of the male protagonist's hardships.

31:15.350 --> 31:18.350
Uphold justice with your martial arts,
gather allies with chivalry,

31:18.350 --> 31:19.550
and write your own chronicle

31:19.550 --> 31:22.480
of a hero in the martial world.

31:24.350 --> 31:26.750
What's wrong with you?
I won't accept this!

31:50.130 --> 31:51.290
What the hell?

31:56.070 --> 31:56.830
I'm sorry.

32:01.310 --> 32:03.960
In a martial world
where the strong devour the weak,

32:03.960 --> 32:05.070
being a swordsman

32:05.070 --> 32:06.330
without a golden cheat

32:06.590 --> 32:08.200
is a high-risk profession.

32:08.790 --> 32:09.960
With my martial arts skills,

32:09.960 --> 32:12.030
not to mention surviving until next year's
Martial Arts Tournament,

32:12.030 --> 32:15.690
just living until the siege
of the Xiao family would be a blessing.

32:16.310 --> 32:18.110
Looks like

32:18.880 --> 32:20.340
I only have one option now:

32:23.030 --> 32:23.910
lay low.

32:25.480 --> 32:26.880
I'll keep a low profile

32:27.850 --> 32:29.580
and just survive until the end.

32:51.590 --> 32:53.590
Challenge the Gold and Silver Bank?

32:54.790 --> 32:57.880
The Gold and Silver Bank in Zihui
is the territory of the Power Gang.

32:57.880 --> 33:00.480
In the original novel,
Xiao Qiushui triggered

33:00.590 --> 33:03.030
the massacre of his entire family
because of this.

33:03.030 --> 33:04.920
No way I'll challenge
the Gold and Silver Bank.

33:04.920 --> 33:06.850
I'm not going to get myself killed.

33:07.240 --> 33:09.170
I'll just hide up in the mountains.

33:09.550 --> 33:12.470
As long as I stay far away
from those tough plot points,

33:12.470 --> 33:13.680
no villains

33:14.160 --> 33:15.160
will ever find me.

33:29.010 --> 33:31.720
[Xiao Residence]

34:34.130 --> 34:37.030
[Huanhua Sect]

35:04.150 --> 35:05.150
I'm still here?

35:07.150 --> 35:08.080
What's going on?

35:16.630 --> 35:17.800
This stupid system.

35:18.510 --> 35:19.770
I can't get rid of this.

35:34.760 --> 35:35.670
This look?

35:45.230 --> 35:46.190
This braid?

35:49.360 --> 35:50.280
No way.

35:50.660 --> 35:51.590
It's been reset?

36:45.710 --> 36:46.360
Young Master, you are here.

36:46.360 --> 36:47.190
Good day, Young Master.

36:47.190 --> 36:49.990
-Good day, Young Master.
-Morning, Young Master.

36:58.880 --> 37:02.070
So this is what the martial world
looks like?

37:21.630 --> 37:22.360
Big Brother.

37:30.440 --> 37:33.360
Tang Xu, Deng Zhe, and Li Chaofan?

37:34.420 --> 37:36.280
Those three also transmigrated?

37:37.360 --> 37:37.960
Come here.

37:39.070 --> 37:39.800
Big Brother!

37:42.490 --> 37:45.110
Big Brother,

37:45.110 --> 37:47.920
you said we're... "university roommates"

37:49.070 --> 37:50.330
and all in the Qin Club.

37:51.480 --> 37:54.280
Are people in the Qin Club
skilled in martial arts?

37:54.400 --> 37:57.710
Qiushui, are you still drunk?

37:58.750 --> 38:00.920
Big Brother, we're just going to watch
a dragon boat race.

38:00.920 --> 38:02.110
You don't have to be so excited.

38:02.110 --> 38:03.440
Are you messing with me?

38:04.000 --> 38:05.730
Can two people look so similar?

38:08.710 --> 38:11.000
Xiao Qiushui may not be
a top-tier martial artist,

38:11.000 --> 38:12.460
but he has a lot of friends.

38:12.960 --> 38:14.230
These three must be

38:14.230 --> 38:15.330
the three best friends
of the male protagonist

38:15.330 --> 38:16.590
in the original novel.

38:17.920 --> 38:19.590
How can they look exactly

38:19.590 --> 38:21.280
like my real-life friends?

38:22.110 --> 38:23.440
What kind of bug is this?

38:29.990 --> 38:30.680
[Zuoqiu Chaoran,
Bone-Dismantling Immortal]

38:30.680 --> 38:31.380
[Good at Joint Lock]

38:31.400 --> 38:32.970
[Tang Rou, heir of Tang Sect,
good at hidden weapons]

38:32.990 --> 38:34.440
[Deng Yuhan, son of the sect leader
of Hailin Sword Sect]

38:36.110 --> 38:37.570
I can't keep a low profile,

38:37.760 --> 38:39.030
and I can't run away.

38:39.800 --> 38:42.110
Since I must follow the original plot,

38:43.000 --> 38:44.960
it looks like the only way to survive

38:44.960 --> 38:46.820
is to hide behind these brothers.

38:47.000 --> 38:49.150
Honestly, I don't know what should I say
about Big Brother.

38:49.150 --> 38:51.190
He passed out drunk at the door at night

38:51.190 --> 38:53.000
and couldn't even find his own room.

38:53.000 --> 38:54.670
You two shouldn't let him
drink anymore in the future.

38:54.670 --> 38:55.230
I...

38:56.280 --> 38:57.000
We wouldn't dare.

38:57.000 --> 38:57.710
I didn't.

38:58.590 --> 39:00.450
Alright, alright, stop talking.

39:15.840 --> 39:18.840
I'll have some water. I am a bit thirsty.

39:20.400 --> 39:21.070
Zuoqiu,

39:22.670 --> 39:25.710
how's your Joint Lock coming along?

39:28.570 --> 39:32.450
Big Brother, why are you looking at him
when talking to me?

39:28.590 --> 39:30.650
[Zuoqiu Chaoran,
Bone-Dismantling Immortal]

39:42.230 --> 39:42.880
Tang Rou.

39:55.030 --> 39:55.710
Cheers.

39:56.880 --> 39:57.970
[Tang Rou, heir of Tang Sect]

39:57.970 --> 39:59.060
[Deng Yuhan, son of the sect leader
of Hailin Sect]

40:04.590 --> 40:05.320
Big Brother,

40:05.690 --> 40:08.600
I heard you got scolded by Mr. Xiao again.

40:09.190 --> 40:12.050
Does that mean we have to postpone
our trip to Zihui?

40:15.150 --> 40:16.280
I came here this time

40:17.050 --> 40:18.850
to discuss this matter with you.

40:19.920 --> 40:22.180
This Dragon Boat Festival trip to Zihui,

40:22.230 --> 40:24.740
we're not going to watch
the dragon boat race.

40:24.740 --> 40:25.470
There,

40:26.710 --> 40:28.970
we'll to meet a gang that bullies people.

40:29.190 --> 40:31.250
It's called the Gold and Silver Bank.

40:32.750 --> 40:34.110
I knew there had to be another reason

40:34.110 --> 40:35.370
Big Brother called us.

40:35.670 --> 40:37.070
There's another fight coming up.

40:37.070 --> 40:38.480
All you know is fighting.

40:38.800 --> 40:40.480
Over the years,
the four of us have specialized in

40:40.480 --> 40:42.920
taking down these unscrupulous rich gangs.

40:42.920 --> 40:43.650
Big Brother,

40:44.150 --> 40:44.800
just tell us—

40:44.800 --> 40:46.260
what's the plan this time?

40:48.400 --> 40:50.920
We're not going to fight this time.

40:52.480 --> 40:54.010
We're going to ambush them.

40:55.110 --> 40:55.880
Ambush them?

40:56.920 --> 41:00.030
Big Brother,
you're acting a bit off today.

41:00.320 --> 41:02.480
Big Brother always has a plan.

41:02.710 --> 41:04.320
Let's hear him out first.

41:12.960 --> 41:13.840
Do you know

41:14.960 --> 41:18.770
who's behind the Gold and Silver Bank?

41:20.710 --> 41:21.590
Who is it?

41:22.070 --> 41:24.840
Fu Tianyi, a demon from the Power Gang.
